Z||000005||ChadMan||11-17-1999||04:01 PM||||That's great!  Reminds me of the street-racing adventures I used to have in my 82 Plymouth (Mitsubishi) Champ - a fine little 64-hp motor and 4-speed gearbox surrounded by a poorly made tin-sh*t car.  Good kill on the Festiva - it's one of the quickest sh*tbox cars.<P>I had to ditch the Champ after I hit a patch of ice and rammed a curb at a whopping 5 mph, doing serious suspension damage.  But that mishap forced me to buy my first Fiero!||||reg||10
